<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<%= render "shared/page_hero", eyebrow: "About", title: "A small family business, printing in Northern Virginia." %>
<div class="page"><div class="wrap two">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Parallex Prints makes personalized coasters, watch stands, desk signs and gifts on our own 3D printers. Every piece is made to order: you choose the colors and the words, and we print it.</p>
    <p>We keep a small, chosen palette on the shelf: black, white, grey, navy, tan, chocolate brown and ruby red. We sell through <%= link_to "our Etsy shop", Catalog::SHOP_URL, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>, you can follow us on <%= link_to "Facebook", Catalog::FACEBOOK_URL, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>, and we take custom work directly, including logos, events and gifts for teams.</p>
    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <p>The paintings on the Dragon Fruit, Migraine Headache and Hearts coasters are original art by Lena. We credit the people whose work we use.</p>
    <p><%= link_to "Shop on Etsy", Catalog::SHOP_URL, class: "btn", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></p>
  </div>
  <aside class="card">
    <h3>Get in touch</h3>
    <p><a href="mailto:<%= Catalog::EMAIL %>"><%= Catalog::EMAIL %></a></p>
    <p><%= link_to "Ask for something custom", made_to_order_path %></p>
    <p><%= link_to "Facebook", Catalog::FACEBOOK_URL, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %></p>
  </aside>
</div></div>
